<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NEOIMMUNE AI</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#08110d;color:#fff}
header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 8%;background:#0d1813}
.logo{color:#f6b73c;font-size:24px;font-weight:bold}
nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:90px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0c1712,#153325)}
.hero h1{font-size:48px;color:#f6b73c}
.hero p{max-width:700px;margin:20px auto;line-height:1.6;color:#d8d8d8}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#f6b73c;color:#000;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}
section{padding:60px 8%}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:20px}
.card{background:#122019;border:1px solid #2d4738;border-radius:12px;padding:22px}
.card h3{color:#f6b73c;margin-bottom:10px}
.sim{background:#102118;border-radius:12px;padding:28px}
input[type=range]{width:100%}
#risk{font-size:32px;color:#6fe08c;margin-top:16px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:24px;background:#0d1813;color:#aaa}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">NEOIMMUNE AI</div>
<nav><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#research">Research</a><a href="#sim">Simulator</a></nav>
</header>
<section class="hero">
<h1>Evolution-Aware Cancer Research</h1>
<p>A proposed computational framework integrating tumor mapping, safety validation, therapeutic red-team testing, and longitudinal monitoring.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#research">Explore Project</a>
</section>
<section id="about">
<h2>About</h2><br>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3>Tumor Mapping</h3><p>Model heterogeneous tumor clones.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Safety Filter</h3><p>Evaluate predicted normal-tissue risk.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Therapeutic Red Team</h3><p>Stress-test escape mechanisms.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="research">
<h2>Research Workflow</h2><br>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3>1. Patient Data</h3></div>
<div class="card"><h3>2. Tumor Mapper</h3></div>
<div class="card"><h3>3. Digital Twin</h3></div>
<div class="card"><h3>4. Strategy</h3></div>
<div class="card"><h3>5. Red Team</h3></div>
<div class="card"><h3>6. Monitoring</h3></div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="sim">
<h2>Mini Evolution Simulator</h2><br>
<div class="sim">
<label>Treatment Pressure</label><br><input id="p" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="60"><br><br>
<label>Evolution Rate</label><br><input id="e" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="40"><br><br>
<button class="btn" onclick="run()">Run Simulation</button>
<div id="risk">Risk Index: 52</div>
</div>
</section>
<footer>Research Prototype • NEOIMMUNE AI</footer>
<script>
function run(){
 const p=+document.getElementById('p').value;
 const e=+document.getElementById('e').value;
 const r=Math.round(p*0.6+e*0.4);
 document.getElementById('risk').innerText='Risk Index: '+r;
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
